{"id":57646,"date":"2026-08-07T16:08:15","date_gmt":"2026-08-07T15:08:15","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-21T04:33:03","modified_gmt":"2026-10-21T03:33:03","slug":"maratona-de-milao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-milao\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Mil\u00e3o 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Mil\u00e3o 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Mil\u00e3o 2027<\/strong> (25\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <em>Wizz Air Milano Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>4 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, consolidando-se como a maratona mais r\u00e1pida em solo italiano (com marcas de refer\u00eancia de 2:06:35 no setor masculino e 2:20:15 no setor feminino). Com partida e chegada no cora\u00e7\u00e3o monumental da <strong>Piazza del Duomo<\/strong>, em <strong>Mil\u00e3o, It\u00e1lia<\/strong>, o evento mobiliza anualmente mais de 40.000 participantes no \u00e2mbito do <em>Milano Running Festival<\/em>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso em anel de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> combina o patrim\u00f3nio hist\u00f3rico lombardo \u2014 passando pelo <strong>Teatro alla Scala<\/strong>, <strong>Castello Sforzesco<\/strong>, <strong>Parco Sempione<\/strong> e Arco della Pace \u2014 com a arquitetura contempor\u00e2nea de <strong>CityLife<\/strong> e <strong>Porta Nuova<\/strong>. Em paralelo com a maratona individual (partida \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>), realiza-se \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> a <strong>UniCredit Relay Marathon<\/strong>, estafeta para equipas de 4 corredores ligada ao maior programa de angaria\u00e7\u00e3o de fundos solid\u00e1rios de It\u00e1lia (mais de 140 organiza\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o lucrativas apoiadas).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>RCS Sports &#038; Events<\/strong> e pela <strong>RCS Active Team<\/strong> sob a \u00e9gide da <strong>FIDAL<\/strong> e da World Athletics, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o assegura postos de abastecimento a cada 5 km, tempo limite regulamentar de 6h30, <em>pacemakers<\/em> e anima\u00e7\u00e3o musical ao longo das avenidas milanesas. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">4 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Piazza del Duomo, Mil\u00e3o, It\u00e1lia<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,195 km (Maratona) e Estafetas 4x (Relay Marathon)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">RCS Sports &#038; Events e RCS Active Team<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.milanomarathon.it\/wizz-air-milano-marathon\/regolamento\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Wizz Air Milano Marathon (42,195 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 89,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (lote inicial)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 109,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (fase regular)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 129,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estafeta Solid\u00e1ria<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">UniCredit Relay Marathon (Estafetas 4x)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Equipa Solid\u00e1ria (4 atletas):<\/strong> 220,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Charity Program)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Mil\u00e3o 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 25\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Wizz Air Milano Marathon<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>4 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, com partida e chegada na <strong>Piazza del Duomo<\/strong>, no centro hist\u00f3rico de Mil\u00e3o (It\u00e1lia). A maratona individual parte \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong> e a estafeta Relay Marathon \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e o perfil do percurso de 42,195 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tra\u00e7ado urbano em anel de 42,195 km \u00e9 plano, r\u00e1pido e fluido, sendo considerado o mais veloz de It\u00e1lia. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo regulamentar para concluir a maratona \u00e9 de <strong>6h30<\/strong>, com postos de abastecimento distribu\u00eddos a cada 5 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona e na Relay Marathon?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na maratona individual (42,195 km) as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es evoluem por fases entre <strong>89,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (fase inicial), <strong>109,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (fase regular) e <strong>129,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (fase final at\u00e9 31\/03\/2027). Na <strong>UniCredit Relay Marathon<\/strong> (equipas de 4 elementos), a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o processa-se atrav\u00e9s das 140 organiza\u00e7\u00f5es sem fins lucrativos do <em>Charity Program<\/em> (a partir de 220,00 \u20ac por equipa).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os requisitos m\u00e9dicos e federativos para participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De acordo com as normas da FIDAL, os atletas participantes na maratona competitiva devem possuir filia\u00e7\u00e3o em federa\u00e7\u00e3o nacional reconhecida pela World Athletics ou subscri\u00e7\u00e3o de <em>RunCard FIDAL<\/em> acompanhada do certificado m\u00e9dico agon\u00edstico espec\u00edfico para atletismo (ou inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no regime tur\u00edstico-desportivo para cidad\u00e3os estrangeiros residentes fora de It\u00e1lia).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a Maratona de Mil\u00e3o e onde levantar o dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>RCS Sports &#038; Events Srl<\/strong> e pela <strong>RCS Active Team<\/strong> (grupo RCS MediaGroup). O levantamento do dorsal, chip e kit de atleta realiza-se nos dias que antecedem a corrida no <strong>Milano Running Festival<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Mil\u00e3o 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-04\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Piazza del Duomo, Mil\u00e3o, It\u00e1lia\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mil\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"It\u00e1lia\", \"addressCountry\": \"IT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"RCS Sports & Events e RCS Active Team\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Mil\u00e3o 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 25\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Wizz Air Milano Marathon realiza-se no domingo, 4 de abril de 2027 , com partida e chegada na Piazza del Duomo , no centro hist\u00f3rico de Mil\u00e3o (It\u00e1lia). A maratona individual parte \u00e0s 08:30 e a estafeta Relay Marathon \u00e0s 09:00 .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e o perfil do percurso de 42,195 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tra\u00e7ado urbano em anel de 42,195 km \u00e9 plano, r\u00e1pido e fluido, sendo considerado o mais veloz de It\u00e1lia. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo regulamentar para concluir a maratona \u00e9 de 6h30 , com postos de abastecimento distribu\u00eddos a cada 5 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona e na Relay Marathon?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na maratona individual (42,195 km) as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es evoluem por fases entre 89,00 \u20ac (fase inicial), 109,00 \u20ac (fase regular) e 129,00 \u20ac (fase final at\u00e9 31\/03\/2027). Na UniCredit Relay Marathon (equipas de 4 elementos), a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o processa-se atrav\u00e9s das 140 organiza\u00e7\u00f5es sem fins lucrativos do Charity Program (a partir de 220,00 \u20ac por equipa).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os requisitos m\u00e9dicos e federativos para participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"De acordo com as normas da FIDAL, os atletas participantes na maratona competitiva devem possuir filia\u00e7\u00e3o em federa\u00e7\u00e3o nacional reconhecida pela World Athletics ou subscri\u00e7\u00e3o de RunCard FIDAL acompanhada do certificado m\u00e9dico agon\u00edstico espec\u00edfico para atletismo (ou inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no regime tur\u00edstico-desportivo para cidad\u00e3os estrangeiros residentes fora de It\u00e1lia).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza a Maratona de Mil\u00e3o e onde levantar o dorsal?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela RCS Sports & Events Srl e pela RCS Active Team (grupo RCS MediaGroup). O levantamento do dorsal, chip e kit de atleta realiza-se nos dias que antecedem a corrida no Milano Running Festival .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70404,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,31],"event_type_2":[627,1059],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57646","ajd